{"id":"letom","lemma":"летом","pos":"adv","rank":1418,"glosses":["in summer"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Baldandersss-%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BC.wav","examples":[{"text":"Что ты делал этим летом?","en":"What did you do this summer?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null,null]},{"text":"Я хотел работать этим летом.","en":"I wanted to work this summer.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to work"},null,null]},{"text":"Там холодно даже летом.","en":"It's cold there even in the summer.","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"coldly"},{"g":"even"},null]},{"text":"Что вы любите есть летом?","en":"What do you like to eat in the summer?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to love","l":"любить"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]},{"text":"Летом там очень красиво.","en":"It's very beautiful there in the summer.","words":[null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"beautifully"}]}]}